`benchmark.meta description: Measures O(1) indexable rewind across a distance of 4,096 tokens.
`benchmark.meta timing: recommended
`benchmark.meta profiles: stream,compile-timing

/core/tokenstream

. depth Size = 4096
. stream = IndexableTokenStream'Char(Char[depth + 1])
. mark = stream.mark()
. checksum = 0 as Size

for iteration in 0 .. < 1000000
    stream.cursor = depth
    stream.rewind(mark)
    checksum += stream.cursor

-- "bench-result stream/rewind-depth-4096 checksum=$checksum"
